      "fieldId": "5a000026-0000-4000-a000-000000000026",
      "value": "Review this boundary when formal governance for SRS is adopted, or when the log shows either failure signal: it has become a task list, or recurring consequential choices lack a recorded rationale and cannot be classified consistently.",
      "agent": {
